ion\":\"Puja Sutar\"},\"description\":\"Puja Sutar is a proficient Content Writer at WsCube Tech. She holds B.Tech. in Electronics &amp; Communication, and M.Tech. in VLSI Design. Her passion for technology and communication is evident in her insightful articles that simplify complex concepts for readers. Puja's writing is a valuable resource for tech enthusiasts and learners alike.\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/author\/pujasutar\/\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255646370\",\"position\":1,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255646370\",\"name\":\"1. What is the roadmap to becoming an ethical hacker?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"An ethical hacking roadmap includes the following steps:<br\/>-Knowledge of computer systems and networks<br\/>-Proficiency in Programming Languages<br\/>-Networking and Security Concepts<br\/>-Web Application and Database Knowledge<br\/>-Understanding of Operating Systems<br\/>-Familiarity with Ethical hacking Tools<br\/>-Problem-solving and Analytical Thinking<br\/>-Knowledge of Common Attack Vectors and Techniques<br\/>-Certifications\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255704386\",\"position\":2,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255704386\",\"name\":\"2. What qualifications do I need to start a career in ethical hacking?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"An ethical hacker career doesn\u2019t require any specific qualifications or degree. However, basic technical and programming skills will be beneficial. You can get a professional certification by joining a reliable ethical hacking course.\u00a0\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255718414\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255718414\",\"name\":\"3. Can I learn ethical hacking online?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Various online platforms like WsCube Tech are available to help you learn ethical hacking. You can join an online ethical hacking course or training program, watch videos, or sign up for tutorials.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255737204\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255737204\",\"name\":\"4. Do I need to know programming to become an ethical hacker?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, you need a basic programming language to be an ethical hacker because it uses Python for automation, scripting, and penetration testing. The best part is our ethical hacking course includes programming fundamentals, so beginners and learners with no technical background can learn ethical hacking.\u00a0\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255751226\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255751226\",\"name\":\"5. What tools should I learn as an ethical hacker?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Your ethical hacking roadmap must include tools like Burp Suite, Kali Linux, Hydra, Nmap, John the Ripper, Metasploit, and Wireshark.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255788983\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255788983\",\"name\":\"6. How can I practice ethical hacking skills?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You can use the given legal and safe platforms for practice:<br\/>-TryHackMe<br\/>-OverTheWire<br\/>-Hack The Box<br\/>-OWASP Juice Shop<br\/>-Capture the Flag (CTF) challenges\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255810649\",\"position\":7,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255810649\",\"name\":\"7. What industries hire ethical hackers?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Industries like finance, defense, banking, IT, healthcare, and the government hire skilled, ethical hackers to secure their systems.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255825521\",\"position\":8,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255825521\",\"name\":\"8. How long does it take to become an ethical hacker?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The duration may vary depending on your academic background, knowledge, and skills. A comprehensive ethical hacking course can be for 2-6 months, and then you need to do a 6-month internship to be proficient.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255843071\",\"position\":9,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255843071\",\"name\":\"9. What are the job roles available after completing the ethical hacking roadmap?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Once you complete the ethical hacking roadmap, you can apply for the following job roles:<br\/>-Penetration Tester<br\/>-Cybersecurity Consultant<br\/>-Vulnerability Assessor<br\/>-Security Analyst<br\/>-Security Architect\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255868346\",\"position\":10,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255868346\",\"name\":\"10. What is the role of Linux in ethical hacking?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Linux is crucial for ethical hacking as it provides tools and a secure environment for penetration testing, network monitoring, and scripting.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255878728\",\"position\":11,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255878728\",\"name\":\"11. Can a beginner with no technical background follow the ethical hacking roadmap?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Surely, if you are a beginner with zero or little experience in the technical field, you can still start a career as an ethical hacker. However, you must have basic knowledge of networking and cybersecurity fundamentals and gradually learn the advanced tools and concepts.\u00a0\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255897955\",\"position\":12,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255897955\",\"name\":\"12. Are ethical hackers in demand in the job market?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Due to the rise in cyberattacks and attention toward cybersecurity, companies are looking for skilled ethical hackers who can ensure data and system security.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255912426\",\"position\":13,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255912426\",\"name\":\"13. What is the future of ethical hacking?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"With rising security concerns, the future of ethical hacking and ethical hackers looks promising. Advanced technologies like IoT, cloud computing, and AI will open doors to new and lucrative opportunities in cybersecurity.\u00a0\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255924027\",\"position\":14,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255924027\",\"name\":\"14. How important is networking knowledge in ethical hacking?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"As an ethical hacker, networking knowledge is crucial for you. It helps you understand the protocols like DNS, TCP\/IP, and DHCP required for identifying vulnerabilities.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255940192\",\"position\":15,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255940192\",\"name\":\