er career doesn\u2019t require any specific qualifications or degree. However, basic technical and programming skills will be beneficial. You can get a professional certification by joining a reliable ethical hacking course.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255718414","position":3,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255718414","name":"3. Can I learn ethical hacking online?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Various online platforms like WsCube Tech are available to help you learn ethical hacking. You can join an online ethical hacking course or training program, watch videos, or sign up for tutorials.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255737204","position":4,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255737204","name":"4. Do I need to know programming to become an ethical hacker?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, you need a basic programming language to be an ethical hacker because it uses Python for automation, scripting, and penetration testing. The best part is our ethical hacking course includes programming fundamentals, so beginners and learners with no technical background can learn ethical hacking.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255751226","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255751226","name":"5. What tools should I learn as an ethical hacker?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your ethical hacking roadmap must include tools like Burp Suite, Kali Linux, Hydra, Nmap, John the Ripper, Metasploit, and Wireshark.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255788983","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255788983","name":"6. How can I practice ethical hacking skills?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can use the given legal and safe platforms for practice:<br\/>-TryHackMe<br\/>-OverTheWire<br\/>-Hack The Box<br\/>-OWASP Juice Shop<br\/>-Capture the Flag (CTF) challenges","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255810649","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255810649","name":"7. What industries hire ethical hackers?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Industries like finance, defense, banking, IT, healthcare, and the government hire skilled, ethical hackers to secure their systems.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255825521","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255825521","name":"8. How long does it take to become an ethical hacker?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The duration may vary depending on your academic background, knowledge, and skills. A comprehensive ethical hacking course can be for 2-6 months, and then you need to do a 6-month internship to be proficient.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255843071","position":9,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255843071","name":"9. What are the job roles available after completing the ethical hacking roadmap?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Once you complete the ethical hacking roadmap, you can apply for the following job roles:<br\/>-Penetration Tester<br\/>-Cybersecurity Consultant<br\/>-Vulnerability Assessor<br\/>-Security Analyst<br\/>-Security Architect","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255868346","position":10,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255868346","name":"10. What is the role of Linux in ethical hacking?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Linux is crucial for ethical hacking as it provides tools and a secure environment for penetration testing, network monitoring, and scripting.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255878728","position":11,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255878728","name":"11. Can a beginner with no technical background follow the ethical hacking roadmap?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Surely, if you are a beginner with zero or little experience in the technical field, you can still start a career as an ethical hacker. However, you must have basic knowledge of networking and cybersecurity fundamentals and gradually learn the advanced tools and concepts.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255897955","position":12,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ethical-hacker\/#faq-question-1736255897955","name":"12. Are ethi